h place.","The Moon's Sun is highest in the north. The Earth's Sun is lowest in the north."]},{"key":"off_chart","main":false,"sentences":["Most of the Earth day is outside the chart, because the Sun climbs to 32 degrees at noon."]},{"key":"step","main":false,"sentences":["The small break in the Earth curve is not an error. At the end of the day, the Sun is 0.25 degrees lower than at the start."]},{"key":"one_view","main":false,"sentences":["The Earth ground is one view, from the middle of the area, 2 m above the ground.","From a tenth of the points in the area, the ground is higher than 4.5 to 6.4 degrees, as a function of direction. That ground can hide a low Sun."]},{"key":"centre","main":false,"sentences":["The curves follow the Sun's centre, not its upper edge.","The Earth curve includes the effect of the air on the direction of light. The Moon has no air."]}],"also_in_the_source_without_a_path_here":{"lunar_sites":[{"id":"connecting-ridge","name":"Connecting Ridge","lat":-89.46316,"lon_east":222.51045,"ceiling_deg":2.08,"ceiling_rule":"90 - |latitude of the target centre| + 1.54 (the Moon's tilt), from moon_targets.json","year":2026,"year_max_elevation_deg":2.05,"year_max_utc":"2026-Nov-06 14:00","year_max_azimuth_deg":354.58,"year_max_minus_ceiling_deg":-0.03,"year_min_elevation_deg":-2.114,"year_min_utc":"2026-May-28 05:00","year_share_above_level_horizon":0.5252,"year_share_above_ceiling":0.0,"mean_trip_days":29.532,"shortest_trip_days":29.454,"longest_trip_days":29.61,"direction":"anticlockwise (east to north to west)","path_trip_days":29.572,"path_days_above_level_horizon":29.54,"path_days_in_band":29.54}],"earth_places":[{"id":"top-cell","name":"top-ranked cell, Kola and north-west Russia","why":"heads the Malapert lighting list (Low Sun on bare ground, all sites) of ranking.txt","place_lat":68.95,"place_lon":54.45,"cell_id":"68.9_54.3","cell_lat":68.95,"cell_lon":54.45,"region":"Kola and north-west Russia","target":"malapert","band_deg":[0.0,5.55],"best